  _lines:
  - _speakerName: Suspicious Crystal
    _dialogueText: 'Three guardians stand in cold embrace:'
  - _speakerName: Suspicious Crystal
    _dialogueText: "Two seek jewels in their place.\r"
  - _speakerName: Suspicious Crystal
    _dialogueText: 'One awaits the dancing flame - '
  - _speakerName: Suspicious Crystal
    _dialogueText: Restore them all to pass the gate.
